id":"C02-B08","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper turns toward the sheltered silhouette while a soft oversized shadow remains behind them; this introduces an unexamined inner side without treating it as a diagnosis.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B09","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper and the shadow imitate the same reaching posture beneath separate charcoal rain streaks; this suggests that outward care may overlap with an unspoken inner longing.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B10","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper pulls the umbrella farther over the other figure as the shadow presses closer to the helper’s back; this shows protection intensifying while vulnerability remains unspoken.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B11","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper lowers the umbrella and faces the empty space where the shadow had been; this creates a pause for self-observation before interpretation.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B12","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper places both hands on the chest while the umbrella lies tilted nearby; this shows the possibility of noticing personal need before returning to rescue.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B13","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"A tiny gold point appears beneath the helper’s closed hands as rain continues around the body; this symbolizes a vulnerable desire becoming barely perceptible.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B14","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper extends the umbrella halfway between themselves and the other silhouette; this represents care that does not erase the other person’s space or choice.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B15","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The smaller silhouette takes one step toward the umbrella handle while the helper keeps both feet planted; this shows support without total control.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B16","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper’s large shadow separates from the body and settles beside the umbrella; this gives form to the neglected weakness that helping had concealed.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B17","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper faces the shadow and the sheltered figure at the same time, with the gold point between them; this connects compassion with the possibility of another personal motive.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B18","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The helper stands upright while holding the umbrella loosely, and the shadow mirrors the posture instead of pulling backward; this marks a shift from moral self-judgment toward curiosity.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B19","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The black umbrella casts one continuous shadow containing the helper’s outline and a second indistinct form; this introduces the shadow as a symbolic framework for what has been difficult to acknowledge.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null}]}
