    "first_frame_scene": "Open on an intimate symbolic close-up that matches the thumbnail through its exact visual language without repeating its composition: the recurring figure's chalk-lined hand is tightly pressed over the charcoal chest, rain strokes crossing the forearm, while the blurred underside of one black umbrella occupies the upper edge of frame. The small gold accent is almost hidden beneath the hand, suggesting an inner need being covered rather than displayed. No face, text, or secondary character is visible in the first frame. Use the same round-body line treatment, paper grain, charcoal density, and restrained gold as the thumbnail.",
